@startuml OrderStateMachine
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8

[*] --> PENDING_PAYMENT : Checkout Dibuat\n(Reservasi Stok & Kuota Slot)

PENDING_PAYMENT --> PAID : Pembayaran Berhasil\n(QRIS / VA / E-Wallet)
PENDING_PAYMENT --> CANCELLED : Dibatalkan Pelanggan\n(Batas Waktu Bayar Habis / Berubah Pikiran)

PAID --> ACCEPTED : Dikonfirmasi Tenant
PAID --> PREPARING : Tenant Langsung Mulai Masak
PAID --> REJECTED : Ditolak Tenant (Bahan Habis Mendadak)
PAID --> CANCELLED : Dibatalkan Pelanggan (Sebelum Dimasak)

ACCEPTED --> PREPARING : Tenant Mulai Memasak
ACCEPTED --> CANCELLED : Dibatalkan Pelanggan
ACCEPTED --> REJECTED : Ditolak Tenant

PREPARING --> READY_FOR_PICKUP : Masakan Selesai\n(Kirim Notifikasi & QR Code)
note right of PREPARING : Pembatalan dilarang saat\nstatus sudah PREPARING

READY_FOR_PICKUP --> COMPLETED : QR Code Diverifikasi Kasir\n(Makanan Diterima)
READY_FOR_PICKUP --> NO_SHOW : Batas Grace Period Lewat\n(Pelanggan Tidak Hadir)

REJECTED --> REFUNDED : Pengembalian Dana Otomatis

COMPLETED --> [*] : Berikan Rating & Ulasan
CANCELLED --> [*] : Slot & Stok Dipulihkan
REFUNDED --> [*]
NO_SHOW --> [*]

@enduml
